// pb_wire.goose: shared runtime for code generated by protoc-gen-goose.
//
// Protobuf binary wire format primitives only (target ~300 lines):
//   - varint encode/decode (u64; negative int32/int64 encode as 10 bytes)
//   - zigzag for sint32/sint64, computed in u64 (signed overflow aborts
//     under --debug; use `as!` for wrapping casts)
//   - fixed32/fixed64 little-endian, float/double <-> bits
//   - tag (field number + wire type) encode/decode
//   - skip_field, including groups and a nesting depth limit
//   - unknown-field copy
//
// Goose `varint` is NOT the protobuf varint; do not use it here.
// Every message's encode/decode/size_of is generated per message; nothing
// message-specific belongs in this file.
//
// Stub: implemented by the Phase 1 pb_wire tasks (see `bd list -l runtime`).
